'''Maccabi Umm al-Fahm F.C.''' ({{Langx|he|מכבי אום אל פאחם}}) are a [[association football|football]] club, from the north Israeli city of [[Umm al-Fahm]]. The club currently plays in [[Liga Bet]] North B division, the fourth tier of [[Football in Israel|Israeli football]]. Home matches are played at the [[HaShalom Stadium]]."}}
